  "scope": "CN16 first recyclable burnout completes its original draw and suspended parent; subsequent burnout retains immediate victory; ordinary score checks after completed top parent precede lower chain response in the executed branches. Current internal lethal cleanup is independently source-failing issue99 and remains OPEN. Exact Hwei mandatory discard, printed draw2, existing preselected Portal CARDS tie and runtime-granted paid Insight Echo only; consumer mapping and reproduced inner-cleanup victory-order issue99 remain OPEN.",
