        "page": 33,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "303.1"
        ],
        "text": "303.1.            任何性质的游戏行动,同一时间内仅可进行一个,且必须完整执行。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "afd89af52c96b351d285460936e4d3356aafb0a9ae9d17de83561efc6fbb4d43"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P038-B014",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P038-B014",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 38,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "319.5"
        ],
        "text": "319.5.          某个结算链项目出于任意原因从结算链上被移除后",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "ec9be3734eb64ae4f05074bfad61afd87c7d9693710b11eba87d2edc7669d495"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P038-B018",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P038-B018",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 38,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "320"
        ],
        "text": "320.       清理 进行过程中,不会对结算链项目 进行确认 或结算 。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "3de741c8fd8b5dc6cc789b1a90388beb354a6111eb3e0de33b8d969e156ac22d"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P038-B019",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P038-B019",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 38,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "320.1"
        ],
        "text": "320.1.          新的待处理项目可以被添加到结算链,但已确认项目不会执行,且优先行动权与焦点不会在此时授予玩家或传递。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "4a773d7e1ad5ed1a5b798c337e1fc55819c6deca59e0b4fb24590054b7fa9b61"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P038-B020",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P038-B020",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 38,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "321"
        ],
        "text": "321.       同样,在结算链项目结算 期间,不会发生清理。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "fe0a1b0a5d86345cf67e99f0f859467d97dcbc2090a9b8b870616c073ea65574"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P038-B021",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P038-B021",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 38,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "321.1"
        ],
        "text": "321.1.          如果在结算链项目结算 期间发生了满足清理条件的事件,则将该次清理列入未决任务。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "072fae699024c616ae04ee9d00a367b7b805be1ff38382c7fafd89bc93f8b3c9"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P038-B022",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P038-B022",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 38,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "322"
        ],
        "text": "322.       如果在清理期间发生了满足清理条件的事件,则在前一次清理完成后立即执行另一次清理。重复此流程,直至清理不再改变游\n           戏状态为止。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "505afe605c53d08bb04a266baba4ba3fc18b97d87abd31b21c13704c8de9f1d8"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P039-B003",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P039-B003",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 39,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "323.1"
        ],
        "text": "323.1.          1.如果一名玩家的分数大于或等于胜利得分,且高于所有对手,则该玩家获胜。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "97b91816a1e45d22477c705af8858efde30fe49cac9d4674eb6999219998445c"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P039-B009",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P039-B009",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 39,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "323.4"
        ],
        "text": "323.4.          3a.所有被标记了致命伤害的单位视为被摧毁,并将置于其所属者的废牌堆。\n                      想获取更多有关致命伤害的信息,请查阅规则 142.4.。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "c25d8c2275684636fe16f4fe1eb9a4527bf9ca85debb0b65a64ab8e5bfd13381"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P072-B010",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P072-B010",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 72,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "414.4.c"
        ],
        "text": "414.4.c.             抽取完成抽牌行动所需的其余卡牌。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "eae8cbc91699b75a4094f2e236750a6505a8fef6fdb96211abb45542c833d8f5"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P081-B020",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P081-B020",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 81,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.1"
        ],
        "text": "432.1.          如果玩家尝试将一张或多张卡牌从主牌堆移动至任意其它区域,且移动的数量超过主牌堆剩余卡牌的数量,则必须\n                执行燃尽:",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "d22046049e36ba5ef248c7eb14918b682613875824348952da078c62bcd4ca23"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B004",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B004",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.            要执行燃尽,玩家需要遵循以下步骤:",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "ea015f013acf80dc4cd1038d61fa63a01ef890347c11789893baedd47d1c4611"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B005",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B005",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.a"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.a.               尽可能完成指示中的行动。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "bc318c72d00b723e137ba68293ae40113cfd48c118aed95580cd75c65c60e43b"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B006",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B006",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.b"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.b.               将废牌堆的卡牌回收至主牌堆。\n                            提示:当多张卡牌同时被回收至主牌堆时,必须先行洗匀。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "8e041943a6d0230a47deb27b9a4f93aa69c8b15a74ea4bef715ef89193feec79"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B007",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B007",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.c"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.c.               选择一名对手,使其获得 1 分。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "5132ab9253101cff38063a6924167f50bdba77e4c193317523577d91e86f22cb"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B008",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B008",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.d"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.d.               完成原本让自己触发燃尽的剩余行动。\n                            举例:一名玩家在主牌堆耗尽的情况下,在抽牌步骤尝试抽取一张卡牌,因此触发燃尽。该玩\n                            家转而将废牌堆回收后放入主牌堆,照常洗匀;然后选择一名对手,使其获得 1 分;最后,该\n                            玩家抽一张牌。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "d4775863e53bea8cb84d49a3c4eb0aaabaeb443ecc9dfccc11d1b79b0271b793"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B009",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B009",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.            玩家的主牌堆可能在执行燃尽后仍然为空,这通常是因为其废牌堆同样为空。当其尝试再次执行原本触发燃尽的行\n                  动时,将再次触发燃尽。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "71c6e5558cde49f11b552dd485e80f6ed91d19519c684872ba08b31134c01b62"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B010",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B010",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3.a"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.a.               除非有其他效果干预,否则这一过程将使该玩家持续执行燃尽,每次令一名对手获得 1 分,直至一名对手\n                       到达胜利得分、赢得游戏。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "6ebedd0cafa88e24579c18ae2714a3d40b6423c1f6fffa8c47e68dde7c03dba1"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B011",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B011",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3.b"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.b.               在第一个燃尽按顺序处理后获得的分数无法通过任何方式替换或阻止。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "5e19281c5237a7017e06eb733c5c8425b004e8cb2d5b6d3a73eaabbcdeae61be"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B012",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B012",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3.c"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.c.               在按顺序处理第一个燃尽后获得的分数,如果使玩家的得分达到或超过该模式的胜利得分,并且该玩家的\n                       得分高于所有对手,则该玩家将获胜。\n                            举例:如果玩家的牌堆和废牌堆均为空,且将要抽一张牌,该玩家会开始反复燃尽。在首次燃\n                            尽结算后,任何后续燃尽只要让某位玩家的得分超过胜利得分,并且高于所有对手,该玩家就\n                            会赢得游戏。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "acd5313e1cc1086e7433c58702ee6c7d656fccab569a61e1f91c9ba07ca45da4"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B013",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B013",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3.c.1"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.c.1.                  该玩家立即获胜,无需等待清理发生。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "58f7b0d65de5f1f829a5dd5c90323f90cf2d65fceb751decd68bf7886272d8d7"
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B018",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B018",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "474"
        ],
        "text": "474.         当清理发生时,如果玩家累计的分数大于或等于其游戏模式的胜利得分,且分数高于所有对手,则该玩家赢得游戏。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      },
      "originalLedgerTextHash": "e2945da643018e24c7c5cfb5865e0b5dd702379052d139943a71e372e29fd454"
    }
  ],
